flowchart LR
    DB[(Migration Working DB)] --> Source[Replication Source]
    Source --> Cloud[Cloud Replication]
    Cloud --> Target[SAP Target Replication]

    Target -->|Stores documents| Staging[(Staging Tables)]
    Target -->|Calls| API[RAP API]

    Scanner <-->|Retrieve| API
    Catalog[SKP Catalog] <--> Scanner[Scanner]

    API -->|Creates workers| Workers
    Staging <-->|Workers consume documents| Workers

    subgraph Workers[Parallel Workers]
        direction LR
        Worker1[Worker 1]
        Worker2[Worker 2]
        WorkerN[Worker N]
    end

    Workers -->|Batch Commit| Commit[Commit per Worker] 
    Commit -->|Creates SAP documents| Documents[(SAP Documents)]

